%% alt: Text is split by a tokenizer into token IDs; the model gives a probability for every possible next token; a sampler, set by temperature and top-p, picks one; the token is appended and the loop repeats inside the context window.
flowchart TB
  T[Text]:::data --> K[Tokenizer]:::tool --> I[Token IDs]:::data
  subgraph W[Context window]
    I --> M[Model]:::model --> P[Probability for<br/>every next token]:::data
    P --> S[Sampler<br/>temperature, top-p]:::control --> N[Next token]:::data
    N -->|append and repeat| M
  end
